    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55514" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταφῐλ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>kiss, caress</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίφρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					6.4.10
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεῖρας καὶ πόδας τινός</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				7.5.32
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Epit.</u>
				56
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				4.10.20
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς μὲν καλοὺς φιλήσοντος, τοὺς
				δ᾽ ἀγαθοὺς καταφ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				2.6.33
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				553
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
