				1.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				26.49
			</span></i>; dist. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλεῖν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.478
			</span></i>; esp. of an amorous kiss. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Am.</u>
				13
			</span></i>.</div>
